      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a944c958a4d4.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a944c958834e.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a944c959b86e.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Hiii evrybody!! Back to school is VERY soon, in like 3 days for me, so I try to do as much stuff as possible before school starts. So, here is a non-villager mod!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;°❀⋆࿔&amp;nbsp; *:･&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;img src="https://archives.bulbagarden.net/media/upload/5/5d/Spr_b_5b_197.png"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img src="https://archives.bulbagarden.net/media/upload/8/8a/Spr_5b_165_m.png" alt="Male"&gt;&amp;nbsp;°❀⋆࿔&amp;nbsp; *:･&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a very proud french citizen, but not patriotic (except during world cups), I love making fun of the clichés surrounding my country. And when I started playing ACNL when I was little, I was so angry at the fact that the red tower we're used to see wasn't the overly mediatic Tour Eiffel (if you mayyy), but a Tokyo tower, that i didn't know at that time. So here is me solving my childhood traumas, hope you'll envoy having this beatiful building in your town ;))&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;u&gt;NB:&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;If you have some ideas for mods you can ask pretty much anything, and i'll try to make it come to life as much as i can, i'd love that!!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Works both on emulator and hardware btw!!</description>
